OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs 'proactive' project to
OL,4,Akeep women safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire Police scheme cracking
OL,7,Fdown on attacks against women aims to
OL,8,F"make sure vulnerable women are
OL,9,Fprotected", the region's mayor said.
OL,11,FProject Vigilant is designed to stop
OL,12,Fsexual violence by identifying and
OL,13,Fdisrupting concerning behaviour before
OL,14,Fa crime is committed.
OL,16,FUniformed and plain-clothed officers
OL,17,Fwill be deployed in targeted city
OL,18,Fcentre areas, working with venues,
OL,19,Ftransport providers and taxi drivers to
OL,20,Fidentify issues and share information.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
