OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs 'proactive' project to
OL,4,Akeep women safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Mayor Tracy Brabin said:
OL,7,F"Quite frankly, if you're a predator
OL,8,Fand you think it's easy pickings here
OL,9,Fin West Yorkshire, you've got another
OL,10,Fthink coming."
